<tr bgcolor=#336699><td colspan=4><font size=2 face=verdana color=gold>Background</font></td></tr>
<tr><td colspan=4><font size=2 face=verdana color=#ffffff>As a young cleric of the high elves i am still exploring the vastness of this great world. I have had the pleasure to see the other lands by travel.  I am amazed at what i see every time i venture to one of these lands to see if i can find my family. Family you say?  yes i have 2 older brothers, Keyline, and Keline.  They are warriors traveling the land also, hopefully looking for me.  How come you are a cleric of the high elves?  well, that my friends is a long story.  My father was a barbarian from the winter lands of everfrost, he was wise and strong.  He traveled the land often, much like my brothers do, in search of rewards, helping ppl when he could.  During this time, his first wife was killed by the Lady Dragon herself, Vox.  He could not live anymore in Everfrost, and hence his travel to a far away land called Faydwer, stopping in a city called Felwithe, talking with the wise ppl there.  He then found my mother during a worshipping of Tunare, and they found true love together.  A few months later I appeared on the scene.  My father was killed trying to save some travelers as he was crossing the continent of Velious. But i don't want this to be a sad story.  My mother raised me alone at this time worshiping and teaching me the values of helping others and healing them, hence my profession of being a cleric.  I have started the journey that my father was taking, trying to find adventure and enjoyment and happiness traveling the lands. So if you run across me in the lands, just know that i will try to help you however i can.  May the god of Tunare look out for you, and be safe in your journeys.  Oh by the way, if you see my brothers, tell them i am looking for them! <G>&nbsp;</font></td></tr>

